        {
          "type": "pieges",
          "items": [
            "<i>I am knowing</i> → <i>I **know**.</i>",
            "<i>She playing</i> → <i>She **is** playing</i> : BE est obligatoire.",
            "<i>He is runing</i> → <i>He is ru**nn**ing.</i>",
            "<i>Do you working?</i> → <i>**Are** you working?</i>"
